graph TD
    A[Vesicle Docking] --> B[Rab GTPase Activation]
    B --> C[SNARE Complex Formation]
    C --> D[V-SNARE Recognition]
    D --> E[T-SNARE Binding]
    E --> F[SNARE Complex Assembly]
    F --> G[Membrane Proximity]
    G --> H[Fusion Pore Formation]
    H --> I[Membrane Fusion]
    I --> J[Content Release]
    J --> K[Membrane Fusion Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> L[Synaptotagmin Binding]
    L --> M[Calcium Sensing]
    M --> N[Calcium-Triggered Fusion]
    N --> I
    
    %% Regulation
    K --> O[Fusion Status]
    O --> P{Membrane Integrity?}
    P -->|Normal| Q[Fusion Inhibition]
    P -->|Compromised| R[Fusion Activation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    S[Rab GTPases] --> B
    T[V-SNARE] --> D
    U[T-SNARE] --> E
    V[SNARE Complex] --> F
    W[Synaptotagmin] --> L
    X[Calcium] --> M
    Y[Fusion Proteins] --> H
    
